(0x01a0923af3037b4fac89eacf6945c9e5, '2026-09-11 20:48:51.971713', '2026-10-05 01:37:58.077822', '2026-09-10 00:00:00.000000', 'Dear Vitalii,\n\nThank you for applying for the Senior PHP Developer role at Altamira. \nWe appreciate the time and effort you put into your application. \nOur team has received your application and will carefully review it.\n\nRest assured that we will contact you within the next five working days \nto discuss the next steps in our recruitment process. \nIf you do not receive feedback within this timeframe, \nit may indicate that we have decided to proceed \nwith other candidates who better match our current requirements.\n\nWe encourage you to learn more about Altamira by exploring our website \nand social media channels to gain a better understanding of our company culture and values.\n\n Our hiring process typically consists of several stages, including:\n\n    1. Recruiting Interview\n    2. Technical Interview\n    3. Client Interview (optional)\n    4. Pre-Offer Call\n    5. Reference Check\n    6. Offer\n\nOnce again, thank you for considering Altamira as your potential employer. \nWe look forward to the possibility of working together\n and wish you the best of luck with your application.\n\nWarm regards,', NULL, 0x01a08c681d057cb993756ed2c1745f29, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
