(0x01a0a4949ca77ad78b4854c498f712c5, '2026-09-15 10:19:57.991683', '2026-10-05 01:37:58.041531', '2026-09-14 00:00:00.000000', 'Dear Vitalii,\n\nThank you for applying to eduki. \nWe genuinely appreciate your interest in joining our team \nand the effort you\'ve invested in your application.\n\nWe have received a large number of applications for this position,\nand after careful consideration, we regret to inform you that we have decided \nnot to proceed with your application. \nUnfortunately, we\'ve determined that your skills are not sufficiently pronounced \nfor the current requirements we have for a Senior Back-End Developer (all genders). \n\nWhile your experience as a Software Developer is highly valued, \nwe are currently searching for Back-End Developers (all genders) \nwho already have a broader commercial experience with microservices. \nThis requirement is crucial for us to ensure a fast onboarding process \nand an immediate impact in the role from day one. \nAs your self-assessment indicates that your profile doesn\'t include this specific experience, \nwe are unable to move forward with your application at this time.\n\nWe understand that this notice may be disappointing \nand would like to emphasize that this decision does not represent a general assessment of your qualifications \nor skills but only relates to the suitability of your profile for the current vacancy.\n\nThank you again for your interest in working with us. \nWe wish you all the best and every success in your future career.\n\nDo you want your personal information deleted immediately? \nPlease let us know by replying to this email. \nOtherwise it will be automatically deleted after 180 days.\n\nKind regards,\nJuliane', NULL, 0x01a08c681d0f756e9412f65bf38ed555, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
