(0x01a0a5babb2072aca06b65f21f0137e3, '2026-09-15 15:41:13.376161', '2026-10-05 01:37:57.978963', '2026-09-15 00:00:00.000000', 'Application received\n\nHi Vitalii!\nThank you for showing your interest by applying for an advertised position as PHP developer \nfor Immense Group (remote, long term) in VIDEOSLOTS LTD.\n\nYour application has been received by us and will be processed shortly. \nWhen the application process has been completed, you will be informed of the outcome.\n\nWe use one of the industry\'s most advanced CV and candidate systems, \nwhere most of the work takes place electronically. \nIn order for us to have the best possible basis for evaluating you for the position, \nwe ask you to make your application profile as complete as possible.\n\nEven if the application process is now underway, you can still enter more information on your CV, \nupload more documents, follow the process of the job(s) you have applied for, etc. \nOnce you have registered with us once, you can also apply for several positions in our system with just one click. \nWe ask that you answer the questions you find in your profile as quickly as possible.\n\nRemember:\nThe more supplementary information you enter, the greater the chance that we can match you to vacancies we have. \nThis means that while we may not have the job of your dreams right now, we may have it at a later date. \nIf you keep your CV up to date, and we find a job that we believe may suit your skills and background, \nwe will contact you if you are still interested.\n\nIf you have any questions, you are welcome to contact us, \nfurther information can be found on our website. \nYou can delete your profile at any time if you wish.\n\nWe wish you a continued pleasant day!', NULL, 0x01a0a5aa2c3f719385827de740782942, 0x01a1084464e179dc91356f71aca2a75f),
